{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-03_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-03","title":"회전","storyCode":"3-3","avgTag":"작전 후","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"3e7d6fb80592af568a7f69029ec6a4a2d8517d46e8aa6c81ff948cec36a360ed","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"로도스 아일랜드의 기습으로 인해 전투에 돌입할 준비를 하는 스컬슈레더는 망설이는 미샤를 다그치곤, 반드시 미샤에게 돌아와 함께 집으로 돌아갈 것을 약속한다.\n한편 W는, 스컬슈레더를 도울 계책을 강구하게 되는데……","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十五关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"잘 봐."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"응…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"이게 방아쇠야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"탄환은 이렇게 넣고…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"조준을 한 다음에 방아쇠를 당겨."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그럼 탄환이 발사된다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그리고 손잡이를 잡은 다음에."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"정신을 집중해서… 아츠를 쓰는 거야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그럼 탄약을 폭발시킬 수 있어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"내가 할 수 있을까…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"할 수 있을 거야, 반드시."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"너한테선 나랑 비슷한 무언가가 느껴지거든."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"상상하는 거야…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"자, 이 오리지늄을 잡고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"으으……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"정신을 집중해."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"손바닥이 조금… 뜨거워."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그거야!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"역시, 내 눈은 틀림없어…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"미샤, 넌 틀림없이, 분명… 하하, 하하…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"넌 틀림없이 내…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"…가자! 스컬슈레더, 퇴각이다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"이 광산을 빠져나가야 한다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"무슨 일이지?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드가 여길 기습했다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그 쓰레기 녀석들이…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"허둥대지 마라, 전원 반격 준비!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"스컬슈레더…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드라면… 우리를…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…뭐하자는 거야. 로도스 아일랜드랑 이야기라도 해보라고?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"그 사람들이라면 분명 감염자들을 도와줄 거야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드는 내 동포를 수도 없이 죽였다…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그런데도 넌 내게 녀석들과 대화를 해 보라는 거냐?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"내 동포들은 모두 감염자였어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"감염자를 구하겠다고 하던 로도스 아일랜드가, 내 동포들을 구해줬던가?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"대체 뭐가 네 판단을 어지럽히고 있는 거지?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"모, 모르겠어…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…미안하다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"너무 흥분했군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"하지만 확실한 건…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"드디어 감염자들이 희망을 손에 넣었다는 거야, 리유니온이라는 희망을."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"하지만 로도스 아일랜드는 우리와 마찬가지로 감염자면서… 우리를 공격하고, 죽이려 하고 있어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"이런 자들은 배신자라 불려야 마땅하지 않나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"배신자들과 무슨 이야기를 할 수 있겠냐고!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"정말로 감염자들은 서로를 죽이고, 서로의 손에 죽는 길밖에 없는 거야?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그럼 나보고 어쩌란 말이냐…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"동포의 죽음을 가만히 보고만 있으라고?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"걱정하지 마."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"우리가 널 지켜줄게."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"너도 네 몸을 잘 지키고 있어라…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"전투에 말려들지 말고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"절대로…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"너도… 꼭 돌아와야 해…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"나도 이제야 겨우…"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"그래, 반드시 네 곁으로 다시 돌아올게."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"그리고 같이 집으로 돌아가자…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"응…"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"안녕."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"역시 내 도움이 필요한가 보네?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그래."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"상황이… 탈룰라가 말한 거와는 좀 다르게 돌아가는 것 같더군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"생각보다 적이 강하다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그러니, 넌 무슨 일이 있어도 미샤를 지켜라."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"난 그럴 의무가 없는데?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"있다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어, 알았어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"그런데, 미샤를 지키기만 해선 뭔가 부족하지 않아?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"만약 너희들이 실패하면 녀석들이 추격해올 텐데?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"무슨 방법이라도 있나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"스컬슈레더, 전에 내가 알려준 거 기억해?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…기억하고 있다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…그 목표물만 처리한다면 전세가 역전될 거야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname} 박사…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"그래, 적의 지휘관을 처치하는 거야. 간단한 일이지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"토끼한테 딱 붙어 있는 후드 쓴 녀석 말이야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드의 모든 전투를 그 녀석이 지휘하고 있어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"그 녀석만 죽이면, 똑! 하고…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드 놈들의 머리가 떨어지는 셈이지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"그럼 모든 게 다 일사천리라 이 말씀~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"우린 지금 규모도 크지 않은 데다 쓸 수 있는 전술도 적어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"광산 근처가 매복하기에 적합한 지형이었지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"우리 캐스터들이 엄호해 줄 테니… 네가 뭘 해야 할지는 잘 알겠지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"내 부하들이 녀석들을 유인해 줄 거야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"이 기회를 놓치지 말라고~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"알겠다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…미샤를 부탁하지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"안심해~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"후우, 그럼… 무운을 빌게."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["미샤"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["리유니온 멤버"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["스컬슈레더"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
